  ──────────────────────────────────────
  ■ Convoy interrupted in 2m 19s — 2/3 tasks done
    • routes (pending): stopped; runs again on resume
  Spent: 2.0M tokens · $1.20 (est.)
  Convoy: convoy-1791044097553
  Branch: convoy/search-export (from main)
    Review: git diff main...convoy/search-export
    Merge:  git merge convoy/search-export
  Log: .opencastle/logs/convoys/convoy-1791044097553.ndjson
  Resume with: opencastle convoy resume</code></pre>
            </div>
            <p class="recipe-section__body">
